	"Name": "Okta Threat Overview",
	"Description": "Is anything happening? The alerts the kit raised (tag _alerts) by priority and detection, then the signals the statistical detections watch, ranked and without thresholds so activity below the alert line shows too: invalid-credential failures by IP and user, shared device tokens, Okta Verify push activity, Okta threat signals, risky and new-behavior sign-ins, users in several countries, proxies, password resets, rate limits and a map of failed sign-ins. Locations come from Okta (client.geographicalContext).",
